OL,3,AEarly release scheme could see
OL,4,Adangerous criminals released,
OL,5,AConservatives warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FTimothy's comments followed Andy
OL,8,FBurnham's announcement that the early
OL,9,Fprisoner release scheme would be
OL,10,Ffurther narrowed to exclude anyone
OL,11,Fconvicted of manslaughter, following a
OL,12,Fcampaign from the family of PC Andrew
OL,13,FHarper to block the release of two men
OL,14,Fconvicted of his manslaughter in 2019.
OL,16,FBurnham said extra prison space would
OL,17,Fbe found in part by releasing some
OL,18,Finmates serving indefinite sentences,
OL,19,Fknown as IPPs.
